    referenceAnswer: "Directions\n\nWrite an essay of 160 - 200 words based on the picture below. In your essay, you should\n\ndescribe the picture briefly,\n\ninterpret the implied meaning, and\n\ngive your comments.\n\nYou should write neatly on the ANSWER SHEET. (20 points)\n\n（下方是一幅漫画，包含两个人物、对话气泡、山水等元素，下方标注“途 中”  ，人物对话为“别呀，休息一下再接着爬”“累了，我不爬了” ）\n\n（图：见原题）\n\n查看答案与解析\n\n 收藏\n\n参考范文\n\nThe cartoon presents a thought-provoking scene: two individuals are climbing a mountain. One of them, feeling exhausted, says, “I’m tired, I’m not climbing anymore,” while the other encourages him, “Come on, let’s rest for a while and then continue.”\n\nUndoubtedly, the illustrator aims to highlight the importance of persistence. First and foremost, perseverance enables us to continually improve ourselves, thereby equipping us for future career advancement and preparing us to face upcoming challenges. Moreover, persistence plays a vital role in personal growth. In today’s ever-changing world, perseverance is as essential to personal development as water is to fish. Conversely, if we neglect the value of persistence, we may suffer unimaginable losses.\n\nTherefore, it is crucial to draw positive lessons from this cartoon. On one hand, we should use such examples to inspire the younger generation. On the other hand, we must help teenagers cultivate the awareness of persevering toward their goals. Only in this way can we emerge victorious in the face of adversity.\n\n参考范文译文\n\n这幅漫画描绘了一个发人深省的场景：两人正在爬山，其中一人因疲惫而说“累了，我不爬了”，另一人则鼓励他：“别呀，休息一下再接着爬。”\n\n毫无疑问，作者旨在强调坚持的重要性。首先，坚持能帮助我们不断完善自我，从而为未来的职业发展做好准备，迎接即将到来的挑战。此外，坚持在个人成长中也起着关键作用。在这个瞬息万变的时代，坚持之于个人成长，犹如水之于鱼。反之，如果我们忽视坚持的价值，可能会遭受难以想象的损失。\n\n因此，从这幅漫画中汲取积极的启示至关重要。一方面，我们应当用这样的例子激励年轻一代；另一方面，我们应帮助青少年树立坚持不懈、追求目标的意识。唯有如此，我们才能在面对困难时成为胜利者。\n\n题目点评\n\n话题熟悉度：“坚持”是考研英语写作的经典话题，早在2004年就曾出现过类似主题的漫画“终点又是新起点”。今年的考题再次印证了深入研读历年真",
